OL,3,GNEWSA'I made my vegan egg at home, now 
OL,4,Ait's in Aldi'                          
OL,6,FAn entrepreneur who started making     
OL,7,Fvegan scotch eggs after being made     
OL,8,Fredundant, has secured a nationwide    
OL,9,Fsupermarket deal for her business.     
OL,11,FRhian Caffull, from Malvern, founded   
OL,12,FVeg Life after losing her job leading  
OL,13,Fexpeditions in Africa at the start of  
OL,14,Fthe coronavirus pandemic in 2020.      
OL,16,FWhat began as an idea inspired by a    
OL,17,Ftrip to the pub has since grown into an
OL,18,Faward-winning food business, whose     
OL,19,Fnational success required the building 
OL,20,Fof a factory in just seven weeks.      
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
