OL,3,GNEWSA'I made my vegan egg at home, now 
OL,4,Ait's in Aldi'                          
OL,6,FNow, following a victory on Channel 4  
OL,7,Fcompetition series, Aldi: The Next Big 
OL,8,FSeller, Caffull's signature product,   
OL,9,Fthe Scotchee, is being stocked in more 
OL,10,Fthan 1,000 Aldi stores across the UK   
OL,11,Funtil Friday.                          
